WEBVTT

1
00:01:41.115 --> 00:01:42.815
Thungalukh !

2
00:01:42.904 --> 00:01:46.604
Thungalukh! Inga kudey

3
00:01:46.622 --> 00:01:48.742
Inga keema

4
00:01:48.761 --> 00:01:51.481
Khalumme

5
00:01:55.839 --> 00:02:00.339
Thungalukh! Thungalukh!

6
00:02:01.868 --> 00:02:03.368
Thungalukh...

7
00:02:03.394 --> 00:02:05.414
... the Spirit of Darkness!

8
00:02:05.424 --> 00:02:07.944
Show yourself!

9
00:02:09.255 --> 00:02:11.975
Sedna! You!
No!

10
00:02:12.037 --> 00:02:16.337
I have protected your clan since time
immemorial.

11
00:02:16.396 --> 00:02:20.316
But now, you forsake me and call upon the spirit of evil!

12
00:02:20.344 --> 00:02:22.464
I no longer need your protection.

13
00:02:22.488 --> 00:02:24.788
Thungalukh is all powerful.

14
00:02:24.829 --> 00:02:29.949
With your words you damn yourself and your entire clan.

15
00:02:29.962 --> 00:02:32.782
I'm taking the animals away.

16
00:02:40.965 --> 00:02:49.997
Legend of Sarila

17
00:03:02.467 --> 00:03:05.937
Where are all the animals?
It's been three moons!

18
00:03:05.971 --> 00:03:08.809
I hope the others have better luck than us.

19
00:03:11.594 --> 00:03:14.814
The shaman says the spirits are angry with the clan.

20
00:03:14.829 --> 00:03:17.049
The shaman should bring back the animals.

21
00:03:17.054 --> 00:03:18.854
What's he waiting for?

22
00:03:24.761 --> 00:03:26.149
Kai kai .

23
00:03:27.663 --> 00:03:29.002
Miki miki.

24
00:03:40.686 --> 00:03:43.058
- Here.
- You can speaks with lemmings?

25
00:03:43.096 --> 00:03:45.335
I...
No!

26
00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:49.301
Only shamans can speak with animals.

27
00:03:49.377 --> 00:03:50.728
Hand it over!

28
00:03:50.804 --> 00:03:52.441
I want to keep him.

29
00:03:52.519 --> 00:03:54.587
Animals are food!

30
00:03:55.536 --> 00:03:57.356
But he's so tiny.

31
00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:58.850
Apik is right.

32
00:03:58.856 --> 00:04:00.976
That little guy isn't even one mouthful.

33
00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:02.527
It could feed a dog.

34
00:04:02.597 --> 00:04:05.424
Poutulik!
Make your future wife happy!

35
00:04:05.454 --> 00:04:07.574
Alright.
But hide him!

36
00:04:07.671 --> 00:04:09.979
Everyone's hungry.

37
00:04:11.329 --> 00:04:13.642
I'll call you Kimi.

38
00:04:14.516 --> 00:04:17.243
Well!
At least we're not coming home empty-handed.

39
00:04:17.255 --> 00:04:18.975
Oh... what hunters we are!

40
00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:20.974
Instead of bringing home game.

41
00:04:20.975 --> 00:04:24.065
We're bringing home an extra mouth to feed.

42
00:04:33.118 --> 00:04:35.591
Black lichen.

43
00:04:35.672 --> 00:04:38.699
I didn't think I would find any more of this.

44
00:04:40.082 --> 00:04:44.279
- What are you doing?
- Making a cure for the Chief's wife.

45
00:04:44.397 --> 00:04:46.717
I'm going to be a healer when I grow up.

46
00:04:46.782 --> 00:04:51.897
In that case, you must learn the secrets of plants.

47
00:04:52.551 --> 00:04:56.490
Sandwort's roots.
Their secret is ...

48
00:04:56.548 --> 00:04:59.745
-... you can eat them.
- I'll keep them for my brother.

49
00:05:10.148 --> 00:05:13.148
Don't be scared, Kajuk!
He won't eat you.

50
00:05:13.163 --> 00:05:16.733
Be careful, Mipuluk!
The dogs are hungry too.

51
00:05:28.063 --> 00:05:31.763
Once again, Shaman.
Our hunt has yielded nothing.

52
00:05:31.781 --> 00:05:34.701
We have neither pelts to trade
nor meat to eat.

53
00:05:34.762 --> 00:05:38.756
I sense evil forces around me.
Weakening my powers.

54
00:05:38.794 --> 00:05:42.100
No one in our clan wants to harm you.

55
00:05:42.686 --> 00:05:44.571
Markussi...

56
00:05:45.167 --> 00:05:49.316
He's just a poor orphan...
... with strange powers.

57
00:05:49.616 --> 00:05:53.072
He's turning your son against you.

58
00:05:54.114 --> 00:05:59.364
Remember!
The spirits speak to me!

59
00:06:05.012 --> 00:06:07.429
Enough!
Break it up!

60
00:06:11.127 --> 00:06:13.397
Markussi!

61
00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:15.866
Little sister!

62
00:06:21.917 --> 00:06:23.784
Stop that!

63
00:06:24.659 --> 00:06:29.290
Kajuk, that's enough!
Kimi got him excited.

64
00:06:29.315 --> 00:06:31.215
Kimi?

65
00:06:34.822 --> 00:06:37.392
Can I hold him?
- He's a talking lemming.

66
00:06:37.417 --> 00:06:38.417
Really?

67
00:06:38.442 --> 00:06:42.310
A talking lemming? Come on Apik.
- See you later, Mipuluk.

68
00:06:42.335 --> 00:06:46.324
A talkling lemming?
- All animals talk.

69
00:06:46.349 --> 00:06:49.283
But we don't listen.
- Do you listen to the animals?

70
00:06:49.308 --> 00:06:51.104
Did they tell you why they left?

71
00:06:51.129 --> 00:06:53.657
Your ask a lot of questions, little sister.

72
00:06:53.682 --> 00:06:56.082
I don't know why the animals left.

73
00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:59.210
And... I don't know if we're going
to eat today.

74
00:06:59.294 --> 00:07:02.821
I know!
- You found something?

75
00:07:02.846 --> 00:07:05.158
It's a surprise.

76
00:07:21.273 --> 00:07:24.583
Drink.
This will do you good.

77
00:07:30.667 --> 00:07:34.187
If she doesn't get meat soon,
the baby will die.

78
00:07:34.246 --> 00:07:37.866
The spirits told me the animals will return.

79
00:07:37.866 --> 00:07:39.786
It will be too late.

80
00:07:39.835 --> 00:07:43.082
We must go to Sarila!
- Sarila?

81
00:07:43.107 --> 00:07:46.907
Oh, shut up you old fox.
You're making the spirits angry!

82
00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:48.709
Let her speak, Shaman.

83
00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:53.517
Long ago, my father told me of a land...

84
00:07:53.542 --> 00:07:56.636
... that lies to the north,
among the glaciers.

85
00:07:56.661 --> 00:08:03.495
Rich with game ... a land
that only the pure of heart can set foot

86
00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:06.773
... and gather its abundance.

87
00:08:06.798 --> 00:08:10.594
Sarila... it's a legend!

88
00:08:11.895 --> 00:08:14.794
If Sarila existed, I would know!

89
00:08:14.819 --> 00:08:16.738
The spirits would have told me.

90
00:08:17.709 --> 00:08:19.529
But what if Sarila does exist?

91
00:08:19.574 --> 00:08:22.796
No. This is no time for fairy tales.Now is not the time to believe the fairy tale!

92
00:08:22.821 --> 00:08:26.606
Shaman! Shaman! Come quick!

93
00:08:33.389 --> 00:08:37.655
Kajuk! Oh, Kajuk!

94
00:08:38.696 --> 00:08:40.962
The dog will die.

95
00:08:45.092 --> 00:08:49.073
You'll save him?
- This dog is possessed!

96
00:08:49.098 --> 00:08:51.506
It must be sacrificed!
- No!

97
00:08:51.512 --> 00:08:55.638
The dog is no longer yours.
It belongs to the spirits.

98
00:08:56.337 --> 00:08:58.157
Give him to me.

99
00:08:58.182 --> 00:09:00.982
Sacrilege! This dog must die!

100
00:09:01.057 --> 00:09:03.384
No! The dog will live.

101
00:09:06.374 --> 00:09:07.774
Calm down boy.

102
00:09:15.615 --> 00:09:18.557
Markussi! Thank you!

103
00:09:19.231 --> 00:09:21.931
Like magic.
How did you know?

104
00:09:21.948 --> 00:09:23.068
He asked.

105
00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.430
Right, big brother?
- He asked?

106
00:09:25.507 --> 00:09:28.851
No! Nothing like that.

107
00:09:29.554 --> 00:09:31.052
Come.

108
00:09:37.637 --> 00:09:41.856
They laughed at me!
It's Because that boy ....

109
00:09:42.125 --> 00:09:45.475
Thinks he's a shaman...

110
00:09:50.211 --> 00:09:55.253
You just wait till he sees
what I've got planned for him.

111
00:10:08.221 --> 00:10:10.362
Press hard!

112
00:10:12.754 --> 00:10:15.054
You're going bear hunting with this?

113
00:10:15.152 --> 00:10:19.906
It's a solid weapon. A flint blade
goes right to the bear's heart.

114
00:10:20.706 --> 00:10:23.074
Stay away, Kajuk!

115
00:10:28.565 --> 00:10:30.903
I love it when you laugh.

116
00:10:30.928 --> 00:10:34.512
You used to laugh at lot with our parents.
Do you remember?

117
00:10:36.433 --> 00:10:40.548
What's the matter?
- I was too young when they died.

118
00:10:42.967 --> 00:10:46.477
Promise me you won't die!

119
00:10:46.502 --> 00:10:48.127
I promise.

120
00:10:54.326 --> 00:10:56.656
It's for hunters.

121
00:11:27.763 --> 00:11:31.160
Well Shaman?
- I have decided.

122
00:11:31.185 --> 00:11:33.957
It's time to go to Sarila.

123
00:11:33.982 --> 00:11:36.246
You believe in it now?

124
00:11:36.271 --> 00:11:38.235
Well.

125
00:11:38.894 --> 00:11:42.085
The spirits spoke to me.

126
00:11:42.586 --> 00:11:44.879
Who do you want to send?

127
00:11:45.879 --> 00:11:49.163
Saya said that only the pure of heart can enter

128
00:11:49.199 --> 00:11:55.144
The Great Crow Spirit can decide.
The hunters will be chosen at sunrise.

129
00:11:55.189 --> 00:11:59.161
I am sure that the Great Crow
will make the right choice.

130
00:12:00.163 --> 00:12:03.036
Ah! Sarila!

131
00:12:05.437 --> 00:12:07.837
Guess who we'll send.

132
00:12:07.877 --> 00:12:10.287
Markussi!

133
00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:12.891
The little know-it-all!

134
00:12:13.051 --> 00:12:16.101
He'll never come back alive.

135
00:12:38.592 --> 00:12:41.860
Inga kudey! Inga keema

136
00:12:41.885 --> 00:12:44.769
Khalumme! Dounma tahkey

137
00:12:45.942 --> 00:12:52.001
Inga kudey! Inga keema!
Khalumme! Dounma tahkey

138
00:12:52.499 --> 00:12:55.395
Spirit of the great crow!

139
00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:58.120
Hear the voices of your children...

140
00:12:58.139 --> 00:13:00.859
... show us the hunter you have chosen ...

141
00:13:00.907 --> 00:13:05.392
... and guide him to Sarila
for the good of our clan.

142
00:13:29.963 --> 00:13:32.951
Apik! The crow chose Apik!

143
00:13:32.976 --> 00:13:36.381
Damn! Stupid crow!

144
00:13:39.795 --> 00:13:41.838
Poutulik too!

145
00:13:43.489 --> 00:13:46.063
No no no!

146
00:13:50.061 --> 00:13:51.997
!

147
00:13:56.449 --> 00:13:58.705
Ah, look Markussi!

148
00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:01.592
Oh... finally!

149
00:14:09.596 --> 00:14:12.143
Welcome to the team, Markussi.

150
00:14:23.879 --> 00:14:25.765
This is crazy!

151
00:14:25.790 --> 00:14:27.900
I'm going to talk to the Shaman!

152
00:14:27.925 --> 00:14:32.180
Ouch! You're hurting me!
I have the right to go.

153
00:14:32.191 --> 00:14:33.739
This is not our way!

154
00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:37.102
Now we should only be
tradition tells the old story.

155
00:14:37.127 --> 00:14:41.127
Do only what the grandparents of our grandparents did.

156
00:14:41.128 --> 00:14:43.533
Never change.

157
00:14:43.558 --> 00:14:47.212
It's how we survive.
- The Great Crow chose me.

158
00:14:47.237 --> 00:14:51.957
What about wild animals?
- It's been many moons since I've seen an animal.

159
00:14:51.982 --> 00:14:56.286
Besides, I'm not afraid.
I know how to talk to bears.

160
00:15:11.282 --> 00:15:13.162
How about some tea?

161
00:15:16.183 --> 00:15:18.432
What's troubling you?

162
00:15:19.304 --> 00:15:21.627
I don't want to go to Sarila.

163
00:15:23.118 --> 00:15:25.059
Why not?

164
00:15:25.084 --> 00:15:27.962
I'm a poor hunter!

165
00:15:28.517 --> 00:15:31.717
Well that's not what they say about you

166
00:15:31.773 --> 00:15:37.738
I can't leave Mipoulok.
- I'll take care of her like my own daughter.

167
00:15:38.546 --> 00:15:41.346
I don't know what's happening to me.

168
00:15:41.371 --> 00:15:45.354
I hear voices.
The animals speak to me.

169
00:15:50.555 --> 00:15:57.255
You have powers.
You will become a great shaman.

170
00:15:57.326 --> 00:15:59.646
Like Croolik?
No! Never!

171
00:15:59.679 --> 00:16:02.399
No!
You'll never be like him.

172
00:16:02.423 --> 00:16:05.043
How could you ever have been his wife?

173
00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:07.868
ooh. That was a long time ago.

174
00:16:07.893 --> 00:16:09.874
He was different.

175
00:16:09.899 --> 00:16:13.599
He changed a lot when our sons died.

176
00:16:13.615 --> 00:16:16.815
Hunting ... with my father.

177
00:16:16.892 --> 00:16:23.936
It was an accident. But Croolik
never forgave your father.
Or me.

178
00:16:23.994 --> 00:16:26.922
My father wasn't a good hunter.

179
00:16:27.247 --> 00:16:32.473
You'd have been proud of him,
and I want him to be proud of you.

180
00:16:32.498 --> 00:16:34.275
Throw them!

181
00:16:39.864 --> 00:16:41.995
Throw athem gain!

182
00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:47.354
It's the way to Sarila?

183
00:16:49.435 --> 00:16:53.143
Go!
The clan needs you!

184
00:16:54.647 --> 00:16:56.926
For the good of the clan.

185
00:16:57.307 --> 00:16:59.580
Thank you Saya.

186
00:17:05.842 --> 00:17:11.508
Big brother? You almost forget your goggles.
You can go snowblind without them.

187
00:17:14.214 --> 00:17:16.746
Will you think of me?

188
00:17:17.071 --> 00:17:20.615
Every day, little sister.
I promise.

189
00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.840
Have faith. And come back quickly!

190
00:17:24.465 --> 00:17:28.203
Are you sure you want to go?
- I won't be gone long.

191
00:17:28.228 --> 00:17:32.157
She'll have time to get to know her future husband
better.

192
00:17:32.782 --> 00:17:35.830
I have taught you how to use this.

193
00:17:36.355 --> 00:17:38.655
Now prove that you are a true hunter.

194
00:17:38.729 --> 00:17:40.614
Wow!

195
00:17:40.939 --> 00:17:44.396
Tell Mother.
I'll bring her a caribou heart.

196
00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:50.515
Son of the Great Chief

197
00:17:52.194 --> 00:17:55.696
Please wear this medallion around your neck.

198
00:17:55.903 --> 00:17:59.326
The invincible wolf will watch over you

199
00:17:59.351 --> 00:18:02.963
... and protect you from harm.
- Thank you, Shaman.

200
00:18:02.988 --> 00:18:06.325
That was nice of Croolik.

201
00:18:09.329 --> 00:18:11.729
I have the best dogs.
I'll lead the way.

202
00:18:11.819 --> 00:18:15.659
If you know the way, I'm ready to follow.
- To the end of the earth

203
00:18:15.684 --> 00:18:17.648
To Sarila!

204
00:18:34.166 --> 00:18:36.342
Faster! Faster!

205
00:19:00.647 --> 00:19:03.681
Thungalukh! Thungalukh!

206
00:19:03.791 --> 00:19:09.660
Give this twin medallion
the power of fire and of darkness!

207
00:19:10.168 --> 00:19:16.932
May my blood make this medallion
my instrument of vengeance.

208
00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:33.270
Try to keep up!

209
00:19:46.859 --> 00:19:47.959
Come on!

210
00:20:15.978 --> 00:20:17.856
Stop!

211
00:20:26.932 --> 00:20:28.352
Hmmmm. The ice!

212
00:20:28.368 --> 00:20:32.088
No!
Don't say it. Don't even think it. You're wrong!

213
00:20:32.112 --> 00:20:34.332
Wooo .. you're a shaman now.

214
00:20:34.337 --> 00:20:36.063
You can read people's minds?

215
00:20:36.122 --> 00:20:40.125
The ice! The ice is too thin!

216
00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:45.877
We must waste time
and go all the way around the bay.

217
00:20:45.902 --> 00:20:48.702
Well I wasn't going to say waste time. I actually would not say a waste of time.

218
00:20:48.739 --> 00:20:50.439
Maybe it is best to play it safe.

219
00:20:50.533 --> 00:20:54.644
No, no. The ice is fine.
It will hold.

220
00:20:54.669 --> 00:20:59.845
Look at this belly. I haven't eaten in so long ...
I'm as light as a little bird.

221
00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.470
You're thinking about flying across?

222
00:21:01.487 --> 00:21:03.487
I'm not heavy enough to break through the ice.

223
00:21:03.539 --> 00:21:07.176
Besides, white ice is strong enough to walk on.

224
00:21:07.176 --> 00:21:09.570
Even for a polar bear.

225
00:21:34.867 --> 00:21:36.613
Jump!

226
00:21:38.473 --> 00:21:40.218
Stop!

227
00:21:48.612 --> 00:21:49.632
Help!

228
00:21:49.653 --> 00:21:52.570
Don't worry! We'll get you.
- Hold on!

229
00:21:54.729 --> 00:21:57.620
Walk across my back! Hurry!

230
00:21:57.700 --> 00:21:59.758
I've got you!

231
00:22:06.611 --> 00:22:09.455
- Oh no!
- Markussi! No!

232
00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:16.070
Come, Markussi.

233
00:22:16.141 --> 00:22:19.798
- How do you know who I am?
- Don't be afraid.

234
00:22:19.872 --> 00:22:23.789
- I am the goddess Sedna.
- But the others...

235
00:22:23.814 --> 00:22:25.814
I've been waiting for you.

236
00:22:25.829 --> 00:22:28.706
Am I dead?
- No.

237
00:22:28.731 --> 00:22:31.631
But you may stay with me if you wish.

238
00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:34.865
I must get to Sarila!
- Why?

239
00:22:34.936 --> 00:22:39.493
The journey's hard!
Very few survive.

240
00:22:39.518 --> 00:22:41.818
You can be happy here.

241
00:22:41.889 --> 00:22:46.714
Goddess! You took away all the animals.
My clan is starving.

242
00:22:47.069 --> 00:22:48.669
Sarila is our only hope.

243
00:22:48.715 --> 00:22:53.772
You have a shaman's heart.
- I am not a shaman. I am a hunter.

244
00:22:53.797 --> 00:22:55.967
Help me!
- No

245
00:23:01.099 --> 00:23:02.665
Starving...

246
00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:05.863
No, Sedna! Starving...

247
00:23:05.888 --> 00:23:08.284
Must save...

248
00:23:11.550 --> 00:23:15.338
Apik! Poutulik!
- We're here, Markussi.

249
00:23:15.385 --> 00:23:17.007
Lie still.

250
00:23:18.696 --> 00:23:22.100
We were afraid we'd lost you.
- Apik!

251
00:23:22.125 --> 00:23:27.442
- What... the sled...
- Poutulik fished you out of the water.

252
00:23:27.467 --> 00:23:29.973
He saved you.

253
00:23:32.045 --> 00:23:35.936
You like the fish you caught?
- It's a little underweight.

254
00:23:35.961 --> 00:23:38.540
Maybe I should throw it back.

255
00:23:51.446 --> 00:23:53.892
Here you go, Uliak.

256
00:23:57.112 --> 00:23:59.572
This is for you.

257
00:24:01.124 --> 00:24:04.913
Wait your turn! You'll get meat
when you've done your work!

258
00:24:04.938 --> 00:24:08.438
Watch it! The Spirit of Darkness will
rip out your tongue!

259
00:24:08.531 --> 00:24:12.831
Don't bring the spirits into it.
They don't listen to you anyway.

260
00:24:12.876 --> 00:24:15.430
You're washed up, Shaman!

261
00:24:18.952 --> 00:24:24.443
What's keeping you from asking Sedna
to release the animals.

262
00:24:24.885 --> 00:24:26.705
Saya has a point.

263
00:24:26.987 --> 00:24:29.245
It's time for the ceremony.

264
00:24:30.315 --> 00:24:35.165
All right. Tomorrow on the pack ice.

265
00:24:40.232 --> 00:24:41.908
Kwatak!

266
00:24:42.532 --> 00:24:45.641
Back here you stupid crow!

267
00:24:45.666 --> 00:24:49.005
Go get that thieving bird, Shaman!

268
00:24:50.174 --> 00:24:52.717
Filthy scum!

269
00:24:52.723 --> 00:24:55.064
Wait till I get my hands on you!

270
00:24:58.587 --> 00:25:01.275
I have a mission for you.

271
00:25:10.009 --> 00:25:12.968
Thungamatlukh

272
00:25:14.158 --> 00:25:16.842
Inkueilukamatlukh

273
00:25:30.359 --> 00:25:34.410
Sedna! Hear the voice of my clan...

274
00:25:34.435 --> 00:25:38.457
Begging your forgiveness and release the animals!

275
00:25:38.482 --> 00:25:42.904
Prove to us by your blood
that you have heard my prayer.

276
00:25:47.047 --> 00:25:53.441
The blood of Sedna!
The Goddess has forgiven us.

277
00:25:54.912 --> 00:25:57.748
Croolik still has his powers.

278
00:26:05.702 --> 00:26:08.572
TWell that little show should shut 'em up.

279
00:26:08.573 --> 00:26:10.040
Oh!

280
00:26:28.752 --> 00:26:32.078
Poutulik!
Come on, stop a minute!

281
00:26:34.277 --> 00:26:35.992
Stop!

282
00:26:36.017 --> 00:26:40.419
It's a little too early to make camp.
- But this is the perfect spot.

283
00:26:41.326 --> 00:26:44.546
Why'd you stop?
- Markussi wanted to look around.

284
00:26:44.617 --> 00:26:46.717
Enjoy the view.

285
00:26:48.176 --> 00:26:50.681
Nice day for a run.

286
00:26:50.685 --> 00:26:54.473
But you need to rest!
- Get on! We'll take turns.

287
00:26:54.474 --> 00:26:57.493
Are you planning to make camp here? Let's go!

288
00:27:01.544 --> 00:27:03.490
There!

289
00:27:10.733 --> 00:27:12.386
Wait!

290
00:27:12.411 --> 00:27:15.297
That looks like... Kwatak!

291
00:27:15.789 --> 00:27:18.663
Croolik's crow.
- You're right.

292
00:27:18.688 --> 00:27:20.987
What's he doing so far from camp?

293
00:27:36.717 --> 00:27:39.675
Hard journey was it?

294
00:27:39.700 --> 00:27:43.564
What news do you have you little me?

295
00:27:45.265 --> 00:27:47.281
Speak clearly!

296
00:27:49.092 --> 00:27:51.990
They've already gone that far?

297
00:27:55.825 --> 00:27:57.677
Poor boy.

298
00:27:57.702 --> 00:28:04.281
He has no idea
how hard this journey will become.

299
00:28:07.435 --> 00:28:12.176
It's either bear tracks or a giant lemming.

300
00:28:14.210 --> 00:28:18.300
Stop joking!
You're scaring Kimi!

301
00:28:18.586 --> 00:28:22.384
A lemming that big could feed
the entire village for the whole winter

302
00:28:23.318 --> 00:28:27.076
The tracks are still fresh.
The bears are not far.

303
00:28:28.556 --> 00:28:32.556
I'll go this way.
- Good! Stay with Markussi.

304
00:28:32.584 --> 00:28:36.561
Follow that lemming!
Quick!

305
00:28:57.070 --> 00:28:58.664
Be careful!

306
00:29:01.106 --> 00:29:03.447
They're so cute!

307
00:29:06.354 --> 00:29:08.436
Look out!

308
00:29:12.313 --> 00:29:14.182
Run!

309
00:29:47.562 --> 00:29:51.243
Thungalukh! Thungalukh!

310
00:29:51.268 --> 00:29:53.168
Ahkee armieal

311
00:29:53.193 --> 00:29:57.266
Ahkee armieal akrabankhtakar...

312
00:30:10.528 --> 00:30:12.857
I was so foolish!

313
00:30:13.584 --> 00:30:16.104
Shhh! Quiet!

314
00:30:16.189 --> 00:30:18.289
What's going on?
- I don't know.

315
00:30:18.322 --> 00:30:20.142
Stay close.

316
00:30:30.336 --> 00:30:32.221
Run!

317
00:30:44.992 --> 00:30:49.012
I am Ookpik, your guardian spirit.

318
00:30:49.060 --> 00:30:52.475
Guardian spirit?
What are you talking about?

319
00:30:52.565 --> 00:30:54.684
I didn't say anything!

320
00:30:54.691 --> 00:30:56.311
You didn't see an owl?

321
00:30:56.398 --> 00:31:01.447
Draw a circle in the snow.
To liberate by power.

322
00:31:01.523 --> 00:31:04.062
Don't stop!
Run!

323
00:31:06.109 --> 00:31:07.824
Oh no!

324
00:31:22.425 --> 00:31:26.869
You... you make fog disappear.

325
00:31:26.894 --> 00:31:30.948
You scare away bears.
You talk to my lemming.

326
00:31:30.973 --> 00:31:32.473
How do you do it?

327
00:31:32.482 --> 00:31:34.757
I have no idea, Apik.

328
00:31:34.782 --> 00:31:38.551
The spirits... talk to me...

329
00:31:38.797 --> 00:31:42.625
Come on. Night's falling.
We should take shelter.

330
00:31:51.712 --> 00:31:56.118
Thank you, Great Bear.
For sustaining our lives in exchange for yours.

331
00:31:58.610 --> 00:32:00.440
Poutulik!

332
00:32:02.026 --> 00:32:04.126
What a great hunter you are.

333
00:32:04.128 --> 00:32:06.656
Oh, my empty belly thanks you.

334
00:32:06.681 --> 00:32:10.072
But it's not enough to feed the whole clan
for the winter.

335
00:32:10.980 --> 00:32:14.267
Poor Poutulik.
A hunter's life is hard.

336
00:32:14.317 --> 00:32:17.792
Don't worry.
There'll be plenty to hunt in Sarila.

337
00:32:21.446 --> 00:32:25.346
The bear looked at me.
So I looked into the bear's eyes and said ...

338
00:32:25.371 --> 00:32:29.094
"Nanook, prepare to die for my clan is hungry"

339
00:32:29.119 --> 00:32:30.319
Did Nanook speak to you?
- No, no.

340
00:32:31.644 --> 00:32:35.479
But I promised I would pour fresh water
in his mouth if I won the fight.

341
00:32:35.504 --> 00:32:36.804
Why?

342
00:32:36.842 --> 00:32:39.062
It's a way of thanking them.

343
00:32:39.073 --> 00:32:43.655
Then Nanook rose up on his hind legs.
He was as big as three inukshuks.

344
00:32:43.680 --> 00:32:45.351
Stop it, Kimi!

345
00:32:45.376 --> 00:32:47.767
He pounced on me and I dropped my gun.

346
00:32:47.792 --> 00:32:51.261
I was sure .. I was going to die!

347
00:32:51.286 --> 00:32:53.398
Huh?
- Apik, are you listening?

348
00:32:53.423 --> 00:32:57.058
What? Yes, yes. Go on.

349
00:32:57.552 --> 00:33:01.052
But I grabbed my gun and without even aiming, fired.

350
00:33:01.077 --> 00:33:05.001
The bear collapsed like an igloo in springtime.

351
00:33:05.026 --> 00:33:08.626
What a great story. You'll have to tell the others
when we get home.

352
00:33:08.715 --> 00:33:11.468
Want to know what happened to us?
- What?

353
00:33:11.493 --> 00:33:13.193
We saw two bear cubs

354
00:33:13.287 --> 00:33:16.207
The mother bear came up behind me.

355
00:33:16.225 --> 00:33:18.545
And Markussi...
- Leave it, Apik!

356
00:33:18.588 --> 00:33:20.904
There's nothing to tell.

357
00:33:21.894 --> 00:33:24.394
A bear with her cubs?
Why didn't you tell me?

358
00:33:24.437 --> 00:33:25.557
No, Poutulik!

359
00:33:25.572 --> 00:33:28.472
They're babies!
What will they do without their mother?

360
00:33:28.497 --> 00:33:31.175
They're probably far away by now.
- Huh!

361
00:33:31.200 --> 00:33:34.401
And you call yourself a hunter.

362
00:33:37.031 --> 00:33:39.831
What do you want, old Witch?

363
00:33:39.905 --> 00:33:42.438
You lied.
I saw you.

364
00:33:42.985 --> 00:33:45.305
What are you talking about?

365
00:33:45.365 --> 00:33:49.430
On the pack ice.
That wasn't Sedna's blood.

366
00:33:49.455 --> 00:33:52.201
You used an animal's bladder.

367
00:33:55.625 --> 00:33:58.059
I am so worried about you.

368
00:33:58.413 --> 00:34:01.433
You're a shadow of who you used to be.

369
00:34:01.483 --> 00:34:03.803
Because what you did to my son.

370
00:34:03.876 --> 00:34:05.976
They were too young to hunt.

371
00:34:06.001 --> 00:34:08.501
But no, you had to send them off
with that miserable ...

372
00:34:08.536 --> 00:34:11.524
Markussi's father had nothing to do with it.

373
00:34:11.549 --> 00:34:17.849
I ruined my legs searching.
It reminds me each and every day what happened.

374
00:34:17.936 --> 00:34:21.256
They were hit by lightning!
It was an accident!

375
00:34:21.341 --> 00:34:22.961
Show some respect!

376
00:34:23.046 --> 00:34:26.166
Don't use that tone with me.
I am a shaman!

377
00:34:26.232 --> 00:34:28.408
You were a shaman.

378
00:34:28.433 --> 00:34:31.533
Now you're twisted by pride and ambition

379
00:34:31.608 --> 00:34:33.128
Insolent hag!

380
00:34:33.151 --> 00:34:35.933
I still have powers!

381
00:34:44.707 --> 00:34:48.860
Go. Go. Find your twin brother.
Go.

382
00:34:52.081 --> 00:34:54.647
You ready boys?
We're going to run today.

383
00:35:19.890 --> 00:35:22.858
Do you see?
Sarila's that way.

384
00:35:25.447 --> 00:35:27.267
Come! We're leaving.

385
00:35:27.331 --> 00:35:30.131
Where are you going?
- Back to camp.

386
00:35:30.156 --> 00:35:32.192
Turn around!

387
00:35:32.217 --> 00:35:34.533
What about Sarila?
- Go on! Climb up!

388
00:35:34.558 --> 00:35:36.671
Hey! What's the matter with you?

389
00:35:36.696 --> 00:35:38.602
Ouch!
- You're coming with me!

390
00:35:38.627 --> 00:35:40.441
Calm down, Poutulik!

391
00:35:44.385 --> 00:35:46.410
Markussi!

392
00:35:46.435 --> 00:35:48.869
What have you done?
No.

393
00:35:48.894 --> 00:35:50.294
Don't touch me!

394
00:35:50.319 --> 00:35:54.181
Poutulik. Stop!
He'll freeze to death!

395
00:36:00.659 --> 00:36:03.058
Markussi!

396
00:36:08.096 --> 00:36:11.375
Do you recognize this one?

397
00:36:11.400 --> 00:36:14.613
Ah... it's a...

398
00:36:16.888 --> 00:36:18.510
Caribou!

399
00:36:23.877 --> 00:36:26.678
Yes! A seal!

400
00:36:30.497 --> 00:36:32.792
What kind of dog is that?

401
00:36:32.817 --> 00:36:36.034
It doesn't look at all like Markussi's dog.

402
00:36:42.074 --> 00:36:44.988
You miss Markussi don't you?

403
00:36:46.262 --> 00:36:48.523
Sure you do.

404
00:37:00.398 --> 00:37:03.659
What's that?
- You'll see.

405
00:37:16.163 --> 00:37:20.540
It's Markussi! It's Markussi!
I see him!

406
00:37:23.892 --> 00:37:25.812
He's gone!

407
00:37:25.901 --> 00:37:30.364
Don't worry.
Markussi will return to us soon.

408
00:37:36.238 --> 00:37:38.439
Markussi...

409
00:37:53.416 --> 00:37:56.628
A person can die out here alone!
- Poutulik!

410
00:37:56.653 --> 00:37:58.367
Let me go!

411
00:37:59.118 --> 00:38:00.635
No!

412
00:38:00.698 --> 00:38:02.386
Stop!

413
00:38:13.620 --> 00:38:15.663
What news?

414
00:38:17.466 --> 00:38:21.440
Ahhh... alone. Abandoned.

415
00:38:22.903 --> 00:38:27.175
Markussi will freeze to death.
Excellent.

416
00:38:28.194 --> 00:38:34.571
But... why I don' I send
a little ice storm just to make sure.

417
00:38:42.508 --> 00:38:45.851
Hey! Stop!

418
00:38:45.876 --> 00:38:47.573
What?

419
00:38:47.898 --> 00:38:50.985
What are we...?
What are we doing here?

420
00:38:51.010 --> 00:38:52.610
Where's Markussi?

421
00:38:52.623 --> 00:38:55.443
What's wrong with you?
You don't remember?

422
00:38:55.486 --> 00:38:57.606
You knocked him out and left him to die.

423
00:38:57.650 --> 00:39:00.381
No!
Markussi is my best friend!

424
00:39:00.406 --> 00:39:02.006
You wouldn't let me go back to help him!

425
00:39:02.068 --> 00:39:04.118
I would never ...

426
00:39:04.143 --> 00:39:06.499
Why can't I remember?

427
00:39:06.524 --> 00:39:08.564
I don't know, Poutulik.

428
00:39:08.589 --> 00:39:12.189
But let's go. Quickly. And find Markussi

429
00:39:12.225 --> 00:39:14.449
Yes. Yes. Of course!

430
00:39:15.960 --> 00:39:17.815
Gah!

431
00:39:39.302 --> 00:39:41.196
Ouch!

432
00:39:41.904 --> 00:39:43.533
Kimi!

433
00:39:52.609 --> 00:39:54.429
Got to move!

434
00:40:05.561 --> 00:40:07.277
Come on!

435
00:40:12.810 --> 00:40:15.507
Pull! Pull!

436
00:40:19.100 --> 00:40:22.196
We have to stop!
- No! Markussi!

437
00:40:22.221 --> 00:40:26.221
I know, but...
- I'm not stopping! My best friend!

438
00:40:26.228 --> 00:40:30.087
We'll all die if we don't take shelter.

439
00:40:47.281 --> 00:40:51.738
Big brother!
I saw you in the shadows.

440
00:40:51.763 --> 00:40:56.098
Mipoulok?
- The hunter's path is long	.

441
00:40:56.123 --> 00:40:58.393
Get up!

442
00:41:02.139 --> 00:41:04.539
Apik... no...

443
00:41:04.610 --> 00:41:07.037
Don't...

444
00:41:21.396 --> 00:41:24.652
Shut up, you stupid crow.
You'll get us caught.

445
00:41:25.722 --> 00:41:29.022
We'll feast tonight, Kwatak.

446
00:41:29.091 --> 00:41:32.950
Celebrate our triumph over Markussi.

447
00:41:34.167 --> 00:41:38.960
Ah... wait... I just thought of something.

448
00:41:38.985 --> 00:41:44.259
I got a little surprise for the old hag too.

449
00:41:48.940 --> 00:41:53.002
When the storm breaks, we'll search for Markussi.

450
00:41:53.027 --> 00:41:57.028
Perhaps ... somehow...

451
00:42:01.992 --> 00:42:04.972
Markussi!
- Oh my friend!

452
00:42:05.823 --> 00:42:07.840
Apik!

453
00:43:01.279 --> 00:43:04.179
Apik tells me I knocked you out.

454
00:43:04.204 --> 00:43:07.342
And left you lying there.
- You don't remember?

455
00:43:07.667 --> 00:43:09.725
None of it.

456
00:43:09.750 --> 00:43:12.950
I know you would never do something like that.

457
00:43:12.980 --> 00:43:16.500
It was evil spirits. Acting through you..

458
00:43:16.545 --> 00:43:19.464
But from where? And why?

459
00:43:20.089 --> 00:43:22.857
We must be on our guard.

460
00:43:24.071 --> 00:43:27.037
Quiet.
Good dog.

461
00:43:28.121 --> 00:43:31.406
How did you survive the storm?
- I...

462
00:43:32.063 --> 00:43:34.156
I had a vision.

463
00:43:35.295 --> 00:43:41.268
I saw Apik crying.
I followed her to your safety.

464
00:43:41.293 --> 00:43:45.544
You do have the power of the shaman.
- I'm not a shaman!

465
00:43:45.569 --> 00:43:48.373
I'll tell Akpik about your powers.

466
00:43:48.398 --> 00:43:50.549
She already knows.

467
00:43:50.874 --> 00:43:52.961
You told her first?

468
00:44:00.526 --> 00:44:03.738
This is thievery of the most base kind.

469
00:44:03.763 --> 00:44:07.063
It's a crime against the entire clan!

470
00:44:07.151 --> 00:44:09.909
The guilty one will be punished!

471
00:44:21.196 --> 00:44:24.186
He's still alive?
No!

472
00:44:24.211 --> 00:44:26.158
I want him to die!

473
00:44:26.183 --> 00:44:32.671
To breath his last! To croak! To kick the bucket!
Embrace the eternal tumble downhill!

474
00:44:35.048 --> 00:44:39.024
I know.
I will turn him into a block of ice!

475
00:44:40.509 --> 00:44:43.498
Yes, you're right.
I sort of decided that already, didn't I?

476
00:44:43.523 --> 00:44:47.295
Besides, ice melts in the spring.

477
00:44:49.444 --> 00:44:54.169
I'll turn him to ash!

478
00:45:02.067 --> 00:45:06.203
Enter the final ingredient...

479
00:45:08.128 --> 00:45:11.058
Yes, yes...

480
00:45:15.098 --> 00:45:17.782
Burn! Burn!

481
00:45:28.651 --> 00:45:30.614
Markussi, look!

482
00:45:35.063 --> 00:45:37.570
What's happening?
- I don't know.

483
00:45:41.545 --> 00:45:43.165
It's the spirits!

484
00:45:43.178 --> 00:45:45.678
They are angry at us.
We have to go back to camp.

485
00:45:45.760 --> 00:45:47.180
No!

486
00:45:47.232 --> 00:45:50.732
These are forces of evil
trying to scare us away from Sarila!

487
00:45:50.757 --> 00:45:51.957
Poutulik's right!

488
00:45:51.982 --> 00:45:54.770
Don't be afraid!
Let's go!

489
00:45:54.795 --> 00:45:57.022
Quick! Quick!

490
00:46:03.785 --> 00:46:06.266
Markussi, come back!

491
00:46:06.648 --> 00:46:08.388
No!

492
00:46:18.368 --> 00:46:20.368
A strange smell.

493
00:46:20.421 --> 00:46:27.713
Evil spirits, evil spirits. Avenge me.
Burn the boy who will challenge my power.

494
00:46:30.529 --> 00:46:36.626
Fire spirit, source of heat and death.
Fly to the boy and turn him to ash.

495
00:46:36.951 --> 00:46:38.796
Rid me of Markussi.

496
00:46:38.838 --> 00:46:41.221
Cursed sorceror!

497
00:46:41.652 --> 00:46:45.761
Leave Markussi alone.
- Hands off me!

498
00:46:46.086 --> 00:46:47.755
Sacrilege!

499
00:47:15.613 --> 00:47:17.434
Do something!

500
00:47:18.259 --> 00:47:20.220
Get us out.

501
00:47:21.245 --> 00:47:24.078
Use your powers, shaman!

502
00:47:24.403 --> 00:47:28.095
I'm... I'm not a Sham...!

503
00:47:29.424 --> 00:47:33.102
Yes... you are a shaman!

504
00:47:35.995 --> 00:47:39.695
Ukpik! Ukpik!

505
00:47:40.293 --> 00:47:43.186
Come! Help us!

506
00:48:27.263 --> 00:48:31.173
Markussi ! Poutulik!
Wake up!

507
00:48:33.294 --> 00:48:35.172
We're alive.

508
00:48:53.637 --> 00:48:55.724
Why'd you stop?

509
00:48:57.001 --> 00:48:59.219
We need sleep.

510
00:49:21.136 --> 00:49:24.995
Are you going to wait until morning
to put out that lamp?

511
00:49:38.029 --> 00:49:40.143
Markussi.

512
00:49:41.526 --> 00:49:45.949
Tonight you have used your powers for personal gain.

513
00:49:45.974 --> 00:49:49.885
Is that the kind of a shaman you want to be?

514
00:49:49.910 --> 00:49:51.713
What are you talking about?

515
00:49:51.738 --> 00:49:55.045
You are drawn to Apik.

516
00:49:55.070 --> 00:49:58.778
It is up to her to choose her partner.

517
00:49:58.803 --> 00:50:01.750
But you have a choice too.

518
00:50:01.775 --> 00:50:04.862
You can use your powers for yourself...

519
00:50:04.887 --> 00:50:07.706
... or for the good of the clan.

520
00:50:08.631 --> 00:50:11.775
Be careful which you choose!

521
00:50:20.622 --> 00:50:23.122
You've made a serious accusation.

522
00:50:23.160 --> 00:50:27.960
I saw him pull a bladder filled with blood
out of the water.

523
00:50:27.979 --> 00:50:33.243
And I heard him call forth the fire spirit against Markussi.

524
00:50:33.268 --> 00:50:35.127
Beware of her.

525
00:50:35.152 --> 00:50:37.795
All she wants is...

526
00:50:39.891 --> 00:50:42.481
What? What is this?

527
00:50:42.806 --> 00:50:45.676
The bones of the hare.

528
00:50:45.701 --> 00:50:48.501
I!
She ​​stole the hare!

529
00:50:48.555 --> 00:50:51.675
I've never seen it...
- She violated the clan's trust.

530
00:50:51.744 --> 00:50:54.425
No! Someone put them there!

531
00:50:54.450 --> 00:50:58.900
No! The bones are in your igloo.
Under your caribou hide.

532
00:50:59.692 --> 00:51:01.147
I must...

533
00:51:01.545 --> 00:51:03.534
I have no choice.

534
00:51:04.259 --> 00:51:06.716
I have to call the clan council...

535
00:51:06.741 --> 00:51:08.761
to judge you.

536
00:51:18.670 --> 00:51:20.253
Look out!

537
00:51:27.914 --> 00:51:30.396
What do you think?
- It's a dead end.

538
00:51:30.421 --> 00:51:33.021
Really?
I thought we could just fly across.

539
00:51:33.077 --> 00:51:35.197
Oh no! It's a dead end for sure.

540
00:51:35.258 --> 00:51:38.885
As hunters, we know these things.

541
00:51:43.973 --> 00:51:46.493
Can't make out either end.
Which way should we go?

542
00:51:46.502 --> 00:51:48.229
Ask the bones.

543
00:51:56.465 --> 00:51:58.085
Huh?
- Impossible.

544
00:51:58.165 --> 00:52:00.169
Throw them again!

545
00:52:03.602 --> 00:52:05.102
We can'tt go that way.

546
00:52:05.170 --> 00:52:07.687
Here's what I think of this magic.

547
00:52:19.115 --> 00:52:22.615
If the bones say straight ahead,
then we go straight ahead.

548
00:52:22.620 --> 00:52:25.440
But, Poutulik, there is no way to across.

549
00:52:25.505 --> 00:52:27.771
There is if we fly.

550
00:52:35.942 --> 00:52:38.142
It's taken us half a winter to get here ...

551
00:52:38.143 --> 00:52:41.087
we're not going to waste time going around.

552
00:52:41.112 --> 00:52:42.787
If you want to cross a crevasse ...

553
00:52:42.788 --> 00:52:46.043
don't ask a shaman.
Ask a hunter.

554
00:52:54.950 --> 00:52:58.306
All's safe.
- On my way.

555
00:53:19.064 --> 00:53:20.524
Grab my hand!

556
00:53:20.549 --> 00:53:22.301
I... I can't!

557
00:53:22.326 --> 00:53:24.287
You can. You have to!

558
00:53:25.980 --> 00:53:27.605
Got you!

559
00:53:34.605 --> 00:53:36.868
It's been a good hunt, my friend.

560
00:53:37.393 --> 00:53:39.746
It's not over yet.

561
00:53:54.384 --> 00:53:56.123
Now!

562
00:54:03.031 --> 00:54:05.752
Sarila better be worth it!

563
00:54:11.062 --> 00:54:14.406
Do you have anything to add, Saya?

564
00:54:15.094 --> 00:54:17.362
I am not guilty!

565
00:54:17.887 --> 00:54:20.415
Who will speak in her favour?

566
00:54:20.840 --> 00:54:25.044
She heals my frostbite.
She cares for Mipuluk like a mother.

567
00:54:25.069 --> 00:54:27.097
She does not deserve to be punished!

568
00:54:27.122 --> 00:54:30.588
Saya saved my wife from fever and cured my brother.

569
00:54:30.613 --> 00:54:33.944
She has done much for our clan.
She ​​should be pardoned.

570
00:54:33.969 --> 00:54:39.906
Saya knows the secrets of the plants.
For the good of the clan, we must set her free.

571
00:54:40.614 --> 00:54:46.722
Let those among you that think
she is guilty, raise their hands!

572
00:54:47.947 --> 00:54:50.893
One... two...

573
00:54:58.601 --> 00:55:00.180
Three!

574
00:55:01.379 --> 00:55:04.144
Three against three.

575
00:55:05.447 --> 00:55:10.947
According to tradition, it's up to the Chief
to break a tie vote.

576
00:55:11.028 --> 00:55:13.435
Justice must be done!

577
00:55:13.596 --> 00:55:16.558
You all know of y affection towards Saya.

578
00:55:16.559 --> 00:55:20.067
She's one of the most respected members of our clan

579
00:55:20.944 --> 00:55:23.587
But I have saw proof of this crime...

580
00:55:23.612 --> 00:55:25.387
... with my own eyes.

581
00:55:26.163 --> 00:55:30.871
I am forced to declare
... Saya ... guilty.

582
00:55:31.396 --> 00:55:32.396
No!

583
00:55:32.491 --> 00:55:35.148
It's unfair!
- She was framed.

584
00:55:35.173 --> 00:55:38.940
In keeping with the ways of our ancestors,...

585
00:55:38.965 --> 00:55:43.018
... you are no longer welcome here Saya.

586
00:55:43.043 --> 00:55:45.469
You must leave this community...

587
00:55:45.494 --> 00:55:48.520
to live on your own as punishment for your crime.

588
00:55:48.521 --> 00:55:50.231
No!

589
00:55:51.049 --> 00:55:53.124
Don'tt worry, Mipoulok.

590
00:55:53.149 --> 00:55:57.672
Hauwee will take care of you until
Markussi returns.

591
00:56:12.572 --> 00:56:17.301
First a crevasse. And now a wall?
- And Sarila on the other side.

592
00:56:26.050 --> 00:56:28.378
Then we're going through.

593
00:56:48.110 --> 00:56:52.391
You must have chipped it.
Somewhere?

594
00:56:54.302 --> 00:56:56.413
That's strange.

595
00:57:00.285 --> 00:57:02.105
What did you find?
- Sedna!

596
00:57:02.130 --> 00:57:03.330
Sedna?

597
00:57:03.963 --> 00:57:09.187
Welcome to the Gate to Sarila.

598
00:57:09.412 --> 00:57:12.112
I couldn't have done it without
Poutulik and Apik.

599
00:57:12.176 --> 00:57:15.193
Is he really talking to Sedna?
About us?

600
00:57:16.494 --> 00:57:20.042
Think back on your journey, Markussi.

601
00:58:15.810 --> 00:58:19.895
You may enter Sarila.
You earned it.

602
00:58:58.356 --> 00:58:59.931
Faster!

603
00:59:05.113 --> 00:59:06.804
Faster!

604
00:59:38.663 --> 00:59:41.567
Wait!
Look! Look! Stop!

605
00:59:54.054 --> 00:59:57.468
Wow!
It's wonderful!

606
01:00:09.149 --> 01:00:13.377
It's even better than I imagined!
- We made it.

607
01:00:13.672 --> 01:00:18.258
It's amazing!
- So beautiful!

608
01:00:29.598 --> 01:00:32.064
Berries!

609
01:00:32.089 --> 01:00:36.180
Greens!
- The clan will have a great feast.

610
01:00:36.917 --> 01:00:38.917
Look!

611
01:01:09.538 --> 01:01:13.738
The clan won't believe we brought back
berries this time of year.

612
01:01:32.613 --> 01:01:34.582
Use your spear.

613
01:01:36.007 --> 01:01:38.196
Get out of the way, Markussi!

614
01:01:42.112 --> 01:01:43.672
Why didn't you kill it?

615
01:01:43.673 --> 01:01:46.181
I couldn't! She's pregnant.

616
01:01:46.206 --> 01:01:48.394
We came here to hunt!

617
01:02:15.605 --> 01:02:18.743
Come on in, Kimi.
The water's fine.

618
01:02:40.404 --> 01:02:44.350
You have passed every test, Markussi.

619
01:02:44.375 --> 01:02:46.532
Will you release the animals, Sedna?

620
01:02:46.557 --> 01:02:48.960
Can my clan hunt once again?

621
01:02:49.467 --> 01:02:53.280
You must do one small thing for me.

622
01:02:53.305 --> 01:02:55.392
Tell me.
It will be done.

623
01:02:55.417 --> 01:03:00.135
No! A true Shaman knows what to do.

624
01:03:00.160 --> 01:03:02.569
But... I don't know.

625
01:03:03.081 --> 01:03:06.781
When you return, do what you must.

626
01:03:06.806 --> 01:03:09.765
And the animals will be released.

627
01:03:09.790 --> 01:03:11.683
Sedna!

628
01:03:11.708 --> 01:03:14.097
What does she want?

629
01:03:20.585 --> 01:03:22.664
Markussi!

630
01:03:23.082 --> 01:03:25.212
Markussi!

631
01:03:44.144 --> 01:03:46.144
Apik!
- Huh?

632
01:03:57.912 --> 01:04:02.650
Poutulik!
Be my arms and my strength.

633
01:04:02.675 --> 01:04:04.897
Avenge me!

634
01:04:12.293 --> 01:04:14.195
Stop it silly.

635
01:04:26.645 --> 01:04:28.701
Poutulik! Be careful!

636
01:04:28.726 --> 01:04:30.750
Is he shooting at us?

637
01:04:30.775 --> 01:04:32.611
Quick!

638
01:04:32.636 --> 01:04:34.361
Quick!

639
01:05:00.676 --> 01:05:03.354
What did you...?
- No time! Hurry!

640
01:05:33.089 --> 01:05:35.838
What... what's wrong with Poutulik?

641
01:05:35.863 --> 01:05:38.118
Do you think he's jealous?

642
01:05:38.143 --> 01:05:40.654
I think... Hurry!

643
01:05:41.864 --> 01:05:44.070
Up this way.
Come on.

644
01:05:47.086 --> 01:05:48.842
Watch out!

645
01:05:48.867 --> 01:05:50.844
Take my hand!

646
01:05:51.515 --> 01:05:53.211
This way!

647
01:06:00.576 --> 01:06:02.330
Look out!

648
01:06:04.422 --> 01:06:06.987
- Now where?
- Follow me.

649
01:06:07.812 --> 01:06:09.012
Poutulik!
- What do you want?

650
01:06:09.625 --> 01:06:11.445
I want you ...

651
01:06:11.456 --> 01:06:12.456
... dead!

652
01:06:12.481 --> 01:06:15.102
Listen to me!
I know it's hard.

653
01:06:15.127 --> 01:06:17.694
But we were only children when we were promised.

654
01:06:17.719 --> 01:06:19.219
Feelings  change.

655
01:06:19.251 --> 01:06:23.902
What are you talking about?
It'll be fine when he's dead!

656
01:06:28.086 --> 01:06:31.876
It's the medallion.
Croolik is controlling him through the medallion.

657
01:06:31.901 --> 01:06:34.423
You sneaking dog.

658
01:06:34.448 --> 01:06:36.683
You want to steal my power?

659
01:06:36.708 --> 01:06:40.372
I'll show you who's the real Shaman!

660
01:06:55.145 --> 01:06:57.045
Hang on!

661
01:07:00.709 --> 01:07:02.594
What?

662
01:07:02.617 --> 01:07:05.264
Markussi!
- Quick! Help!

663
01:07:06.691 --> 01:07:08.411
Grab my hand!
- No!

664
01:07:08.488 --> 01:07:10.372
- You have to!
- No!

665
01:07:10.397 --> 01:07:11.822
- You're...
- It was Croolik's medallion.

666
01:07:11.881 --> 01:07:13.516
Trust him.

667
01:07:13.989 --> 01:07:16.303
Got her!
- Hang on!

668
01:07:22.302 --> 01:07:24.373
Thank you.

669
01:07:27.219 --> 01:07:29.092
Look out!

670
01:07:54.946 --> 01:07:57.321
So young!

671
01:08:00.391 --> 01:08:04.591
We all face the same fate if
the animals don't return.

672
01:08:21.918 --> 01:08:24.532
I brought you something.

673
01:08:27.361 --> 01:08:30.261
A cure made from Black Lichen.

674
01:08:30.286 --> 01:08:32.139
You know Mipoulok.

675
01:08:32.164 --> 01:08:36.141
It is forbidden for anyone to see me.

676
01:08:36.166 --> 01:08:40.410
Even you.
- I don't want youto die, Sayan.

677
01:08:43.251 --> 01:08:47.689
I dreamt of Markussi.
- Really?

678
01:08:47.732 --> 01:08:55.541
You and Markussi were on a big sled
drawn by many dogs.

679
01:08:56.982 --> 01:09:02.582
The sled rose into the sky.
Up to the stars.

680
01:09:02.606 --> 01:09:06.424
Oh! You can dream of Markussi all you like.

681
01:09:06.449 --> 01:09:09.741
It's the only place you'll ever see him.

682
01:09:09.766 --> 01:09:14.425
Your Markussi is buried in the snow.

683
01:09:15.131 --> 01:09:17.601
You are cruel!

684
01:09:28.806 --> 01:09:31.425
How?
- It's Markussi!

685
01:09:34.661 --> 01:09:37.868
That's impossible.
Impossible!

686
01:09:41.687 --> 01:09:43.500
Apik?

687
01:09:43.525 --> 01:09:47.471
You and Markussi are the best friends
I could ever hope to have.

688
01:09:47.496 --> 01:09:50.150
So I can say in all honesty.

689
01:09:50.175 --> 01:09:52.968
I don't think either of us should
be bound by some old promise.

690
01:09:52.993 --> 01:09:54.864
Poutulik...
- No!

691
01:09:54.889 --> 01:09:57.038
Don't say anything.

692
01:09:57.063 --> 01:09:59.125
I understand.

693
01:09:59.150 --> 01:10:00.960
And I agree.

694
01:10:02.952 --> 01:10:05.074
My little Apik ...

695
01:10:10.909 --> 01:10:14.962
You've had a good hunt I see.
- Yes.

696
01:10:14.963 --> 01:10:18.905
And I have changed too.
- No more headstrong ways?

697
01:10:18.930 --> 01:10:21.193
I wouldn'tt say that.

698
01:10:21.218 --> 01:10:24.586
Poutulik and I are no longer promised to each other.

699
01:10:24.999 --> 01:10:27.604
But...
- Traditions are fine mother.

700
01:10:27.629 --> 01:10:29.155
But...

701
01:10:29.160 --> 01:10:32.534
But we must also listen to our hearts

702
01:10:41.950 --> 01:10:44.363
Here, father.

703
01:10:44.388 --> 01:10:46.508
It's yours now, son.

704
01:10:46.533 --> 01:10:49.333
You've proved you are a real hunter.

705
01:10:49.404 --> 01:10:50.404
Thank you.

706
01:10:50.483 --> 01:10:53.554
It will help me on my travels.
- Travels?

707
01:10:53.579 --> 01:10:55.011
You can't be leaving already?

708
01:10:55.012 --> 01:10:57.279
I have discovered it's my path to knowledge.

709
01:10:57.288 --> 01:11:00.656
I want to learn the ways of others.
So I can be better.

710
01:11:00.681 --> 01:11:03.614
And come back as a better chief.

711
01:11:05.304 --> 01:11:07.494
Mipoulok!

712
01:11:07.939 --> 01:11:09.814
Little sister!

713
01:11:10.339 --> 01:11:12.471
Oh, Markussi!

714
01:11:12.496 --> 01:11:16.341
I missed you!
- I will never leave you again.

715
01:11:16.366 --> 01:11:18.537
I promise!

716
01:11:18.945 --> 01:11:21.089
Where's Sayan?

717
01:11:31.722 --> 01:11:34.742
Markussi, cursed one!
Get out of my sight!

718
01:11:34.757 --> 01:11:38.728
Out of your sight?
You are blinded by evil!

719
01:11:38.753 --> 01:11:44.201
Oh, Poutulik!
What are you doing with that stinking rat?

720
01:11:44.274 --> 01:11:46.352
Come here, my friend.

721
01:11:46.377 --> 01:11:48.505
Here's your cursed medallion!

722
01:11:48.530 --> 01:11:50.322
It's powerless.
- Oh...

723
01:11:50.407 --> 01:11:53.582
But I am all powerful.
I am the Shaman.

724
01:11:53.582 --> 01:11:56.075
The spirits are on my side.

725
01:11:57.180 --> 01:12:01.510
How many times have you tried to kill me?
And how many times have you failed?

726
01:12:01.535 --> 01:12:04.746
For your own good,
leave now, false shaman!

727
01:12:04.746 --> 01:12:06.589
Oh no!

728
01:12:06.614 --> 01:12:08.654
We will end this now!

729
01:12:08.679 --> 01:12:10.631
Face to face!

730
01:12:10.656 --> 01:12:12.056
Leave him, Markussi!

731
01:12:12.081 --> 01:12:16.238
Not! Sedna told me a shaman
would know what to do.

732
01:12:16.263 --> 01:12:18.763
I didn't understand then, now I do.

733
01:12:18.846 --> 01:12:21.494
Do you think Sedna can protect you?

734
01:12:21.519 --> 01:12:26.281
Thungalukh, Spirit of Darkness,
Guide my arm!

735
01:12:35.469 --> 01:12:37.599
Ah, yes!

736
01:12:42.295 --> 01:12:46.115
Aeekhlawae khummalook isidiyou ouramatakaiyae

737
01:12:46.174 --> 01:12:48.494
Thungalukh, Spirit of Darkness!

738
01:12:48.521 --> 01:12:53.127
Avenge me!
Kill the insolent boy!

739
01:13:05.922 --> 01:13:12.638
The storm will kill him!
- A true shaman can choke out the storm!

740
01:13:57.802 --> 01:14:00.704
Don't talk!

741
01:14:00.729 --> 01:14:04.028
I took the hare.

742
01:14:05.636 --> 01:14:07.542
Forgive me...

743
01:14:13.623 --> 01:14:18.496
Sweet dreams, Croolik.

744
01:14:22.681 --> 01:14:24.681
Though you never knew joy on earth ...

745
01:14:24.694 --> 01:14:29.528
May the tenderness of fresh water
inspire you in the next world.

746
01:15:04.567 --> 01:15:06.285
Sedna...

747
01:15:06.610 --> 01:15:09.284
Accept our gife.

748
01:15:14.542 --> 01:15:19.574
Thank you, Markussi.
Your clan is forgiven.

749
01:15:19.599 --> 01:15:23.808
Long life to its new Shaman.

750
01:15:27.635 --> 01:15:30.633
We did it!
- No, Shaman.

751
01:15:30.658 --> 01:15:32.419
You did it!

752
01:15:32.444 --> 01:15:35.957
Yeahhh... Markussi!...

753
01:16:00.839 --> 01:16:03.887
Tell a story.
- We were completely buried in the snow.

754
01:16:03.918 --> 01:16:07.338
Starting to suffocate.
I was sure we'd all die.

755
01:16:07.374 --> 01:16:11.394
So? How did you get out?
You dug yourselves free?

756
01:16:11.434 --> 01:16:14.454
How could we? We didn't know which way
was up ... or down.

757
01:16:14.503 --> 01:16:16.023
We were lost in the darkness.

758
01:16:16.112 --> 01:16:18.432
We heard the lemming roaring like a seal.

759
01:16:18.486 --> 01:16:21.286
So we dug in his direction.

760
01:16:30.728 --> 01:16:35.746
Hah! Kwatak the crow is clever.
He's found his new master.

761
01:16:35.771 --> 01:16:37.693
I have no need for Kwatak.

762
01:16:37.718 --> 01:16:40.739
I already have Kimi to watch over me.

763
01:16:44.350 --> 01:16:47.350
So... what will we do with Kwatak?

764
01:16:47.403 --> 01:16:51.439
My wife has a good recipe for crow stew.
